     4292       "Неверное значение параметров вызова p-mode"
     4293       p-mode
     4294       view-as alert-box ERROR.
     4295       return.
     4296    end.
     4297    find first X_cli-obj no-lock where
     4298                   X_cli-obj.obj-type = p-curr-obj-type
     4299               and X_cli-obj.obj-code = p-curr-obj-code no-error.
     4300       if not available X_cli-obj then do:
